OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F355A1787855373
OL,3,CGuernsey FC miss out on FA Cup after 5-
OL,4,C0 defeat
OL,6,FGuernsey FC will not progress into the
OL,7,FFA Cup after losing 5-0 at home this
OL,8,Fafternoon (Saturday 8 August) to
OL,9,FCrowborough Athletic FC.
OL,11,FIt was the first time the teams had
OL,12,Ffaced each other in nearly 14 years,
OL,13,Fas both sides bid for a place in the
OL,14,FFA Cup extra preliminary round at
OL,15,FVictoria Park.
OL,17,FAfter last year's heartbreak of
OL,18,Fnarrowly missing out on promotion to
OL,19,Fthe eighth tier of English football,
OL,20,Fthe Green Lions yet again missed out
OL,21,Fon another opportunity to progress.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/4
