PN,35502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F355A1787855373
OL,3,CGuernsey FC miss out on FA Cup after 5-
OL,4,C0 defeat
OL,6,FThe first half saw Crowborough take a
OL,7,Fthree-goal lead, despite encouraging
OL,8,Fmoments from the Green Lions.
OL,10,FThe Crows' dominance continued as
OL,11,FSamuel-Smikle secured the fourth goal
OL,12,Fin the 70th minute.
OL,14,FGoing into extra time, Crowborough's
OL,15,FElliot Duncan added the fifth and
OL,16,Ffinal goal to their belt to finalise
OL,17,Ftheir win.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/4
