PN,35503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F355A1787855373
OL,3,CGuernsey FC miss out on FA Cup after 5-
OL,4,C0 defeat
OL,6,FReacting to the defeat on Guernsey
OL,7,FFC's social media, manager Tony Vance
OL,8,Fsays: "It was a poor experience for
OL,9,Fthe older players. It wasn't good, but
OL,10,Fit stemmed from the first whistle.
OL,12,F"We looked so lethargic, sloppy, slow.
OL,13,FWe weren't doing the principles we
OL,14,Fkind of demand for the players, and we
OL,15,Fgot found out.
OL,17,F"It was a really poor start, which
OL,18,Fdictated that we were out of the game,
OL,19,Fto be honest.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/4
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
