PN,35504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F355A1787855373
OL,3,CGuernsey FC miss out on FA Cup after 5-
OL,4,C0 defeat
OL,6,F"The first half we gave the game to
OL,7,Fthem, they didn't have to work hard
OL,8,Ffor their goals, they were really poor
OL,9,Fgoals.
OL,11,F"The second half was so much better,
OL,12,Fbut the game had already gone. The
OL,13,Ffirst half lost us the game."
